(7544457, 1207651, 104230, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump.<br/> <br/>Very appealing. It has the feel of a woodcut! A good choice of image for this technique, it captures the activity without the need for too much detail. I love the quintessential four face clock hanging in the center, and for an ex-pat like me that unchanging Boots sign is always a special reminder of Britain!</td>', 'Back to comment and bump. Very appealing. It has the feel of a woodcut! A good choice of image for this technique, it captures the activity without the need for too much detail. I love the quintessential four face clock hanging in the center, and for an ex-pat like me that unchanging Boots sign is always a special reminder of Britain!', '2017-11-14 13:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
