(7545486, 1207975, 83313, '<td valign="top">I shot from this spot about an hour before dawn several months back. Set up my tripod on the outer wall. When done I turned around and forgot the inner wall was there behind me. Hiked up the coast a bit after that and didn''t realize how badly I had bloodied up my knee in the fall until I was in the men''s room at the airport hours later. It was absolutely worth it!</td>', 'I shot from this spot about an hour before dawn several months back. Set up my tripod on the outer wall. When done I turned around and forgot the inner wall was there behind me. Hiked up the coast a bit after that and didn''t realize how badly I had bloodied up my knee in the fall until I was in the men''s room at the airport hours later. It was absolutely worth it!', '2017-11-19 21:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
