(7545583, 1208071, 102278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> did a filter do this? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Done in Photoshop. Took a black and white version of the image into PS. Turned that layer into ''Find Edges'' (i think) then brought in a colour version and mixed the layers using Multiply or something for the colour. Then I added another layer of the paper texture. Took a while playing about with those elements to get it like this.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: did a filter do this?   Done in Photoshop. Took a black and white version of the image into PS. Turned that layer into ''Find Edges'' (i think) then brought in a colour version and mixed the layers using Multiply or something for the colour. Then I added another layer of the paper texture. Took a while playing about with those elements to get it like this.', '2017-11-20 13:09:31.000000', NULL, 0),
